  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n( {4a + (5)/(a) + 5} ) = 14\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n(a + b)² = a² + b² + 2ab\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n( {4a + (5)/(a) + 5} ) = 14\n\n⇒ {4a + (5)/(a)} = 9\n\n⇒ ({4a + (5)/(a)})² = 9²\n\n⇒ {16{a²} + frac{{25}}{{{a²}}}+2.4a.(5)/(a)} = 81\n\n⇒ {16{a²} + frac{{25}}{{{a²}}}+40} = 81\n\n⇒ {16{a²} + frac{{25}}{{{a²}}}} = 41\n\n**∴ The required answer is 41.**",
